**2. TERMINATION**  
Both parties agree that the previous supply relationship has been effectively terminated, with no obligations remaining under any prior agreements, and that there will be no future transactions unless operational and market conditions significantly change. 

**3. CONCLUSIONS**  
In light of these developments, both parties acknowledge the necessity of exploring alternative partnerships and strategies to navigate the significant changes in the agricultural supply landscape.